# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:11
translate italian adrian13_156a2700:

    # "My phone starts buzzing in my pocket. I pull it out and see that Adrian is calling."
    "Il mio telefono inizia a vibrare in tasca. Lo tiro fuori e vedo che è Adrian a chiamarmi."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:15
translate italian adrian13_bea5e8cb:

    # pc "Hello?"
    pc "Pronto?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:16
translate italian adrian13_f9cf1bde:

    # gg "Hey, [pcname]. You busy?"
    gg "Ehi, [pcname]. Sei occupato?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:17
translate italian adrian13_e74e5c12:

    # pc "Not really. What's up?"
    pc "Non proprio. Che succede?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:19
translate italian adrian13_a2d441d4:

    # gg "There's this old arcade over on the east side of town that I haven't been to in years. I was wondering if you wanted to go check it out with me?"
    gg "C’è questa vecchia sala giochi nella zona est della città dove non vado da anni. Mi chiedevo se ti andasse di andarci a dare un’occhiata con me?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:20
translate italian adrian13_9ee91606:

    # pc "I didn't even know we had an arcade in town."
    pc "Non sapevo nemmeno che avessimo una sala giochi in città."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:22
translate italian adrian13_6580f309:

    # gg "Yeah, I think most people have forgotten about it. I don't know how they stay in business."
    gg "Sì, credo che la maggior parte della gente se ne sia dimenticata. Non so come facciano a restare in attività."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:23
translate italian adrian13_7860a0fb:

    # gg "But I kind of wanted to go check it out, just to see what they're doing there, and maybe get some ideas for my arcade."
    gg "Ma in un certo senso volevo andare a dare un'occhiata, solo per vedere cosa ci fanno lì, e magari prendere qualche spunto per la mia sala giochi."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:27
translate italian adrian13_34b5448b:

    # gg "Poggers! Come and get me?"
    gg "Poggers! Vieni a prendermi?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:28
translate italian adrian13_4724ea78:

    # pc "Sure, I'll be there in a few minutes."
    pc "Certo, sarò lì tra pochi minuti."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:29
translate italian adrian13_5b5160ba:

    # gg "Okay, see you then!"
    gg "Ok, ci vediamo allora!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:33
translate italian adrian13_75da4880:

    # gg "Aw, alright."
    gg "Ah, va bene."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:35
translate italian adrian13_c01438a1:

    # gg "Well, if you want to go sometime, just give me a call."
    gg "Beh, se vuoi andarci qualche volta, chiamami pure."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:36
translate italian adrian13_ba01fe47:

    # pc "Okay, see you later, Adrian."
    pc "Ok, ci vediamo più tardi, Adrian."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:37
translate italian adrian13_225cc39e:

    # gg "See ya."
    gg "Ci vediamo."

